      <a href="/products/">商品廚窗</a>
      <a href="/delivery/">配送方案</a>
      <a href="/line/">加入 Line</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-social">
      <a href="https://lin.ee/xFMuRx5" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Line">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 5.82 2 10.5c0 3.94 3.56 7.27 8.36 8.15-.12.97-.46 2.97-.52 3.44-.08.68.24.67.5.49.21-.14 3.19-2.16 4.48-3.04C16.37 19.45 19 17.5 19 15c0-4.68-4.03-8.5-7-8.5z"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100057143992346" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.threads.net/@little_shepherd_goat_milk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Threads">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm0 18c-4.41 0-8-3.59-8-8s3.59-8 8-8 8 3.59 8 8-3.59 8-8 8zm-2-6c0-2.21 1.79-4 4-4s4 1.79 4 4-1.79 4-4 4-4-1.79-4-4z"/></svg>
